      "content": "thanks for the tip. 100-250mg feels like a pretty small amount though, and im already taking a bunch of other stuff for my blood pressure and stuff. i just want something that actually works so i can sleep. do u think i could get away with taking like 400 or 500mg a day? i feel like i need more than that to really hit the cramps.",
